      </summary>
      <div class="gsources-body">
        <p class="gs-row"><span class="gs-k">Last checked</span><span>{bookingTacticsChecked}</span></p>
        <p class="gs-row"><span class="gs-k">Changed since last check</span><span>First published September 2026. Covers the book-direct, perk-negotiation, refundable-rebook, member-rate, own-site, normalise-the-listing and drip-reading tactics, each bounded; the rate-parity position in {parityRows.length} jurisdictions; and the fee-disclosure rules in four. The three visuals are drawn from the figures below and from this site's own hotel tax map.</span></p>
